\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-S.Korea  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  reserves up,  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  seen slowing.  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Yoo Choonsik  \par \uc2 499 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 November 2004\par 07:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SEOUL, Nov 2 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves rose $3.7 billion in two weeks to a record high at the end of October, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed on Tuesday, signalling continued government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 But dealers said the authorities were not as active in the market as late last year when heavy verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and direct dollar buying helped keep the won down against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Bank of Korea data showed South Korea's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, already the world's fourth largest, rose $3.71 billion or 2.1 percent in the second half of October to a record $178.39 billion.  \par \par \uc2 "The data shows the authorities are still buying dollars to cushion some of the pressure (on the won to rise), but their \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not appear as strong as in the past when they tried to turn the direction around," said Lee Jin-woo, research head at NACF Futures Co.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers estimated the authorities had bought nearly $3 billion in the market in the latter half of October.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is rarely commented on by South Korean authorities, although the finance ministry and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  say they undertake smoothing \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the market moves too rapidly.  \par \par \uc2 South Korea's foreign reserves jumped nearly a quarter between July last year and February this year, when the country enjoyed rapid export growth.  \par \par \uc2 Over the period, the won underperformed the yen by as much as 13 percent. The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is closely watched by dealers and policy makers in Seoul, whose exporters are in fierce competition with Japanese counterparts.  \par \par \uc2 DOMESTIC CRITICISM  \par \par \uc2 But strong global oil and raw material prices have since pushed inflation up to three-year highs and the finance ministry has come under pressure to allow some appreciation of the won to cushion import prices.  \par \par \uc2 Opposition lawmakers have criticised Finance Minister Lee Hun-jai for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  too heavily. They argue a cheaper won has helped import inflation and hindered an early turnaround in a two-year slump in local spending by consumers and companies.  \par \par \uc2 Exports have been the main driver of growth in South Korea, Asia's third-largest economy, since it escaped a brief recession early last year, but a persistent slump in local demand is threatening the recovery as exports begin to soften.  \par \par \uc2 The Bank of Korea, which many economists believe wants the finance ministry to allow some appreciation in the won to help cap inflation, also said on Tuesday in a statement a stronger won could help boost corporate investment.  \par \par \uc2 "Empirical analysis on the influence of interest rate cuts on corporate investment shows it is influenced more by GDP growth or \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates than by interest rates," it said.  \par \par \uc2 While the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  appears to be more worried about inflation, finance ministry officials have said they support further cuts in interest rates to support the economy. (Additional reporting by Kim Kyoung-wha).   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041102e0b2005eq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
