\par\par \b \uc2 S.Korea's  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  reserves up at $178 bln by end-Oct.  \b0\par\par\uc2 206 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 November 2004\par 22:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SEOUL, Nov 2 (Reuters) - South Korea's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par reserves rose to a new record high in October due to a surge in\par the dollar-converted value of assets denominated in the euro and\par the yen, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said on Tuesday.\par     Reserves grew to $178.39 billion at the end of October from\par $174.45 billion a month ago, the Bank of Korea said in a\par statement.\par     The increase was attributed to a softer U.S. dollar which\par boosted dollar value of assets denominated in other \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ,\par as well as capital gains over the existing assets, the BOK said.\par  \par     When compared with the end of 2003, the reserves rose 15\par percent.\par     South Korea is the world's fourth-largest holder of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign\par exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves after Japan, China and Taiwan.\par     Dealers suspect monetary authorities have \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to buy\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 dollars and safeguard the won's export competitiveness, leading  \f28 \par \par \uc2 to a steady rise in \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. But the  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  denies \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  and provides few details of its  \par \par \uc2 reserves.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     South Korean reserves ($ million):\par     End-Oct    End-Sept   End-Aug    End-July   End-Jun\par     178,388    174,448    170,492    168,006    167,030.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041101e0b100fa5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
