\par\par \b \uc2 S.Korea bonds flat ahead of Greenspan testimony.   \b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juli 2004\par 03:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 SEOUL, July 20 (Reuters) - South Korean government bond prices were barely changed early on Tuesday, with investors reluctant to trade ahead of testimony by Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan that could set the tone for future U.S. interest rate rises.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par By 0022 GMT, the yield on three-year treasury bonds             was\par flat at 4.19 percent. The five-year treasury bond yield            was\par bid up 1 basis point at 4.49 percent, dealers said.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 "Bond market players are sticking to the sidelines ahead of Greenspan's testimony," said a bond trader.   \par \par \uc2 Greenspan will deliver his semi-annual testimony on monetary policy before the U.S. Senate late on Tuesday and again to the House of Representatives on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 Analysts predict the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chairman will reiterate the Fed intends to raise rates at a measured pace to help keep inflationary pressure in check.   \par \par \uc2 Local bond dealers said market sentiment was still uncertain after the National Assembly decided last week to approve a government plan to issue up to an additional 11 trillion won ($9.51 billion) in treasury bonds this year to fund its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.   \par \par \uc2 On the economic front, \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 's seasonally adjusted jobless rate was 3.5 percent in June, unchanged from May, the National Statistical Office said.   \par \par \uc2 On the Korea Futures Exchange, the key September contract for three-year treasuries rose 1 tick to 110.16.   \par \par \uc2 On the local stock market, the benchmark Korea Composite Stock Price Index fell 1.32 percent. ($1=1157.2 Won).    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040720e07k0001v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
