\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Falls in equities and yen weigh.  \b0\par\par\uc2 608 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 September 2003\par 05:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     SINGAPORE, Sept 11 (Reuters) - Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  were\par pressured on Thursday morning by weakness in regional equity\par markets and the drop in the yen  driven by the fear of\par dollar-buying Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     Trade was thinned by holidays in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 South Korea\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and Taiwan.\par     The Thai baht        was forced off Wednesday's 14-month\par highs and the Indonesian rupiah  failed to profit from\par news of another sale of bank shares by the Indonesian Bank\par Restructuring Agency (IBRA).\par     "The overriding near term factor might be the equity\par markets, where we had a sharp pullback," said Claudio Piron,\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist with Standard Chartered Bank.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "Asian central banks have been willing to allow their\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to appreciate, given that the asset valuations were\par re-inflating and helping all the balance sheets."\par     "But the equity pullback and the fact that the BOJ (Bank of\par Japan) has been in the market as well means we have a pause in\par the appreciation in some of the regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," Piron\par said.\par     Japan's Nikkei average         followed the downtrend in\par U.S. technology stocks, the latter weighed down by the second\par anniversary of the September 11 attacks and the release of what\par was said to be a new tape of al Qaeda leader Osama bin Laden.\par     Regional stock markets also paused after strong rallies.\par     Singapore's stocks were down for a third day, dragged down\par by technology stocks and Tuesday's news that a 27-year old\par medical researcher in the city-state had Severe Acute\par Respiratory Syndrome (SARS), the world's first case since the\par global outbreak was declared over in July.\par  \par     But the Singapore dollar        was not as worried, holding\par near Wednesday's two-week highs around 1.7480.\par     PESO SUPPORTED, BAHT LOWER\par     The Philippine peso        was supported on the firmer side\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 of the sensitive 55 per dollar level by a \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  order,  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 issued on Tuesday, banning residents from buying dollars to  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 purchase dollar-denominated bonds.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Manila-based traders said the measure would not make much  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 of a difference to speculators who have conventionally used the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 black market to bet on peso weakness.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Meanwhile, despite the baht's light pullback, analysts said  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the Thai authorities seemed comfortable with the rapid gains  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has made in recent months.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 James Malcolm, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist at JP Morgan, said the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 baht's real effective exchange rate was just modestly above  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 levels immediately after the 1997/98 Asian financial crisis and  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 that valuations did not appear stretched.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Peter Redward, strategist at Deutsche Bank, said there  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 already were heavy short dollar-baht positions in the market,  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 and fresh positions betting on a higher baht would be  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 attractive only after the baht rose past 40.20.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's main concern is the pace of the move,  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 particularly after the baht has strengthened considerably  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 relative to Thailand's regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  index," Redward said.  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR AT 0320 GMT  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Change on the day   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen     117.15       116.70         -0.38\par  Sing dlr      1.7480       1.7497         +0.10\par  Baht           40.47        40.40         -0.17\par  Peso           54.88        54.95         +0.13\par  Rupiah       8440.00      8425.00         -0.18\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     117.15       118.74         +1.36\par  Sing dlr      1.7480       1.7341         -0.80\par  Baht           40.47        43.08         +6.45\par  Peso           54.88        53.38         -2.73\par  Rupiah       8440.00      8940.00         +5.92 ((Editing by\par John Mair; Reuters Messaging:\par vidya.ranganathan.reuters.com@reuters.net; +65 6870 3090)).\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020030911dz9b000ma\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
