 1,182 on Thursday, dealers say. \par \par \uc2  - U.S. dollar slips moderately overnight against major rivals due to Wall Street declines. \par \par \uc2  - Yen trading at 117.77/80 in morning trade in Tokyo versus a late New York level of 117.79. \par \par \uc2  - On the non-deliverable forward market, one-month won quoted at 1,181.5/2.5 versus 1,181.1/2.8, while three-month won at 1,187.8/8.8 against 1,188.2/9.2. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030710dz7a002bj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
