\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Rupiah rallies, others dither. \b0\par\par\uc2 794 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Mai 2003\par 11:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     SINGAPORE, May 23 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah\par powered to a 21-month high on Friday after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was not overvalued, but other Asian\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dithered on fears of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to thwart any\par strength.\par     In Korea, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  warned against excessive gains\par in the won . The Thai baht  and Taiwan\par dollar  were also contained by worries over\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     "There's a new dilemma in Asia, and that dilemma is do you\par quasi-peg to the yen or do you quasi-peg to the dollar, because\par anybody who appreciates with the yen is appreciating against\par China," said Ray Farris, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and interest rates strategist\par with Credit Suisse First Boston.\par     "That's why we are seeing so much of dollar buying by\par central banks right now because they are beginning to realise\par that they are appreciating against the (Chinese yuan) on a\par cross of relative stability against the yen."\par     The exception seems to be Indonesia.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Asked on Friday if the\par rupiah could reach 8,000 per dollar, last traded in August\par 2000, senior deputy governor Anwar Nasution said: "Depending on\par exports, if oil prices remain high and the IPO of Bank Mandiri\par is successful, then it can reach 8,000."\par     The remark pushed the rupiah above 8,300 per dollar to a\par fresh 21-month high at 8,270-8,280, shrugging off the conflict\par between the Indonesian military and separatists in Aceh\par province.\par  \par     Indonesia is scheduled to sell up to a 30 percent stake of\par Mandiri, the country's fifth largest bank, later this year.\par     In contrast, the won weakened after \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 South Korea\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's Finance\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Ministry said it would \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if it did not move in line\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par with fundamentals. The ministry did not nominate an appropriate\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par level.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Thai \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said this week the baht was still\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par competitive, but was suspected of having \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . While the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par baht was on the strong side of 42 per dollar on Friday, it\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stalled before the nine-month highs it hit this week.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Singapore dollar  held a steady range around\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1.7220, stuck like the yen as markets wavered ahead of a long\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par holiday weekend in America and worried about possible Japanese\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and a rise in U.S. jobless claims.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Analysts said the Sing dollar is in the middle of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par undisclosed trade-weighted band authorities manage it in, and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  might not be averse to some downward\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par movement.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Philippine peso  was marginally higher than\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Thursday's one-month low at 52.98. Manila-based traders said a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par combination of the yen's weakness and import demand had driven\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  down from eight-month highs struck early this\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par month.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par RUPIAH GETS A BOOST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For several Asian economies, China is among the top three\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par export markets, though the biggest end buyer is the United\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par States, and they manage \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to ensure competitiveness.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par As a result, their gains against a weakening U.S. dollar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par have lagged those in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  such as the euro  -\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par apart from the high-yielding rupiah.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupiah is up nearly 40 percent against the U.S. dollar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par since May 2001 - and the same amount against the Chinese yuan\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  , which is pegged to the dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Over the same time, the baht has gained nearly nine percent\par against the dollar and the won 10 percent.\par     Lehman Brothers, in a note to clients, the rupiah offered\par the best value in the region.\par     "Indonesian interest rates remain high, with one-year swap\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par rates at 10 percent, giving a significant carry advantage over\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollars. The carry for going short dollar/rupiah is 70 basis\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par points per month," it said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Perhaps more significantly, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is also\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par talking up the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , implying the same focus on export\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par competitiveness may not apply in Indonesia, as it does in Korea\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par or Taiwan," it said.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR AT 0800 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen     117.25       117.55         +0.26\par  Sing dlr      1.7227       1.7253         +0.15\par  Taiwan dlr    34.707       34.690         -0.05\par  Korean won   1194.00      1195.20         +0.10\par  Baht           41.92        41.99         +0.17\par  Peso           52.79        52.97         +0.34\par  Rupiah       8275.00      8325.00         +0.60\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     117.25       118.74         +1.27\par  Sing dlr      1.7227       1.7341         +0.66\par  Taiwan dlr    34.707       34.753         +0.13\par  Korean won   1194.00      1185.80         -0.69\par  Baht           41.92        43.08         +2.77\par  Peso           52.79        53.38         +1.12\par  Rupiah       8275.00      8940.00         +8.04.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030523dz5n00hwj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
