\par\par \b \uc2  Korea c.bank to step in if  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  mkt seen volatile. \b0\par\par\uc2 104 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 2001\par 01:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SEOUL, Oct 8 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Korea will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if volatility is seen in the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the government said in a statement issued after an emergency meeting of economic ministers on Monday morning. \par \par \uc2  "The government will be closely watching the financial markets. So market participants don't have to over-react to the U.S.-led attack on Afghanistan," it said. \par \par \uc2  The statement came after the United States and Britain bombed Afghanistan late on Sunday. The bombing followed the September 11 attacks on the United States. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011007dxa700xhr\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (South Korea near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrd